@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam activityBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
title Program hot replacement (§6.9)

start
:Candidate with new source revision\nor import closure;
if (Port, ownership, profile, resource\nand state compatibility valid?) then (yes)
  :Commit atomically at a tick boundary;
  :Transfer only same-name, same-type state\nNew state = declared default\nRemoved state disappears;
  :Discard old input cache;\nreceive complete input snapshot\nfor the new schema;
  :New artifact/source identity\nand new run boundary;
else (no)
  :Keep the previous Program;
endif
stop
@enduml
